   540	All reads on Sol (gpt-5.6-sol): editorial, cold read, source-distance (10 tracked passages; one dense scene, ch34 scene 3; one of the ten is now a restored protected unit), plan / canon / protected-text audit (RATIFY WITH LINE FIXES — 21 applied by the coordinator, including the four protected units the author had left as markers). Same-author repair r1 in progress when this block was written; the CLOSED note follows when the recheck returns.
